{"id":"e4304d93d4893c39","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/678_Views_框架逻辑.md","title":"678 Views 框架逻辑","display":"678_Views_框架逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_{678}=(V_{678},\\cdot_{678},\\varepsilon_{678},\\preceq_{678})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal V_{678}=(V_{678},\\cdot_{678},\\varepsilon_{678},\\preceq_{678})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为视图代数参数，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_{678}\">\\(V_{678}\\)</span> 是集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot_{678}:V_{678}\\times V_{678}\\to V_{678}\">\\(\\cdot_{678}:V_{678}\\times V_{678}\\to V_{678}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_{678}\\in V_{678}\">\\(\\varepsilon_{678}\\in V_{678}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_{678}\\subseteq V_{678}\\times V_{678}\">\\(\\preceq_{678}\\subseteq V_{678}\\times V_{678}\\)</span>。原子命令名集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PrimCmd}_{678}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{PrimCmd}_{678}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原子命令规格注册表是类型化参数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PrimSpec}_{678}\n\\subseteq\nV_{678}\\times\\mathsf{PrimCmd}_{678}\\times V_{678}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{PrimSpec}_{678}\n\\subseteq\nV_{678}\\times\\mathsf{PrimCmd}_{678}\\times V_{678}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命令构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prim}\">\\(\\operatorname{prim}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{seq}\">\\(\\operatorname{seq}\\)</span>，显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c;d\">\\(c;d\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-视图代数与判断\">2. 视图代数与判断</h1>\n<p>视图代数满足下列公式。对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v,w\\in V_{678}\">\\(u,v,w\\in V_{678}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(u\\cdot_{678}v)\\cdot_{678}w=u\\cdot_{678}(v\\cdot_{678}w),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(u\\cdot_{678}v)\\cdot_{678}w=u\\cdot_{678}(v\\cdot_{678}w),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\cdot_{678}v=v\\cdot_{678}u,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\cdot_{678}v=v\\cdot_{678}u,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\cdot_{678}\\varepsilon_{678}=u,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\cdot_{678}\\varepsilon_{678}=u,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\preceq_{678}u,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\preceq_{678}u,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(u\\preceq_{678}v\\land v\\preceq_{678}w)\\Longrightarrow u\\preceq_{678}w,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(u\\preceq_{678}v\\land v\\preceq_{678}w)\\Longrightarrow u\\preceq_{678}w,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\preceq_{678}v\\Longrightarrow u\\cdot_{678}w\\preceq_{678}v\\cdot_{678}w.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\preceq_{678}v\\Longrightarrow u\\cdot_{678}w\\preceq_{678}v\\cdot_{678}w.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命令集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\">\\(\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_i\\in\\mathsf{PrimCmd}_{678}\">\\(c_i\\in\\mathsf{PrimCmd}_{678}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prim}(c_i)\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\">\\(\\operatorname{prim}(c_i)\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\">\\(c,d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c;d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\">\\(c;d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Views 三元组集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{VTrip}_{678}=V_{678}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\times V_{678}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{VTrip}_{678}=V_{678}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\times V_{678}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{p\\}\\ c\\ \\{q\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{p\\}\\ c\\ \\{q\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-自由名\">3. 自由名</h1>\n<p>视图元素没有对象语言变量，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{678}:V_{678}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{PrimCmd}_{678}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{678}(v)=\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{678}:V_{678}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{PrimCmd}_{678}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{678}(v)=\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in V_{678}\">\\(v\\in V_{678}\\)</span> 成立。命令名函数定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FC}_{678}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{PrimCmd}_{678})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FC}_{678}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{PrimCmd}_{678})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FC}_{678}(\\operatorname{prim}(c_i))=\\{c_i\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FC}_{678}(\\operatorname{prim}(c_i))=\\{c_i\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FC}_{678}(c;d)=\\operatorname{FC}_{678}(c)\\cup\\operatorname{FC}_{678}(d).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FC}_{678}(c;d)=\\operatorname{FC}_{678}(c)\\cup\\operatorname{FC}_{678}(d).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{678}:V_{678}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{PrimCmd}_{678}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BC}_{678}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{PrimCmd}_{678})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{678}:V_{678}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{PrimCmd}_{678}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BC}_{678}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{PrimCmd}_{678})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为常空函数。没有绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,678}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,678}\\)</span> 是三元组构造树相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-结构操作\">4. 结构操作</h1>\n<p>定义命令名替换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CSub}_{678}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\times\\mathsf{PrimCmd}_{678}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CSub}_{678}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\times\\mathsf{PrimCmd}_{678}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prim}(d)[c:=e]\n=\n\\begin{cases}\ne,&amp;d=c,\\\\\n\\operatorname{prim}(d),&amp;d\\ne c,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{prim}(d)[c:=e]\n=\n\\begin{cases}\ne,&amp;d=c,\\\\\n\\operatorname{prim}(d),&amp;d\\ne c,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(b;d)[c:=e]=b[c:=e];d[c:=e].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(b;d)[c:=e]=b[c:=e];d[c:=e].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义三元组替换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TripSub}_{678}:\\mathsf{VTrip}_{678}\\times\\mathsf{PrimCmd}_{678}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\to\\mathsf{VTrip}_{678}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TripSub}_{678}:\\mathsf{VTrip}_{678}\\times\\mathsf{PrimCmd}_{678}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\to\\mathsf{VTrip}_{678}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(p,c,q)[a:=d]=(p,c[a:=d],q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(p,c,q)[a:=d]=(p,c[a:=d],q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>视图框架操作定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Frame}_{678}(r,(p,c,q))=(p\\cdot_{678}r,c,q\\cdot_{678}r).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Frame}_{678}(r,(p,c,q))=(p\\cdot_{678}r,c,q\\cdot_{678}r).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>视图弱化谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Weaken}_{678}(p,q,p&#39;,q&#39;)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Weaken}_{678}(p,q,p&#39;,q&#39;)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p&#39;\\preceq_{678}p\n\\quad\\text{且}\\quad\nq\\preceq_{678}q&#39;.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p&#39;\\preceq_{678}p\n\\quad\\text{且}\\quad\nq\\preceq_{678}q&#39;.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>Views 原子命令公理族为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Prim}^{678}\n=\n\\{\\{p\\}\\operatorname{prim}(a)\\{q\\}:(p,a,q)\\in\\mathsf{PrimSpec}_{678}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Prim}^{678}\n=\n\\{\\{p\\}\\operatorname{prim}(a)\\{q\\}:(p,a,q)\\in\\mathsf{PrimSpec}_{678}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{678}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{Prim}^{678}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{678}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{Prim}^{678}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<p>后果、框架和顺序规则分别显示为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\{p\\}c\\{q\\}}{\\{p&#39;\\}c\\{q&#39;\\}}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Weaken}_{678}(p,q,p&#39;,q&#39;),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\{p\\}c\\{q\\}}{\\{p&#39;\\}c\\{q&#39;\\}}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Weaken}_{678}(p,q,p&#39;,q&#39;),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\{p\\}c\\{q\\}}{\\{p\\cdot_{678}r\\}c\\{q\\cdot_{678}r\\}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\{p\\}c\\{q\\}}{\\{p\\cdot_{678}r\\}c\\{q\\cdot_{678}r\\}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\{p\\}c\\{q\\}\\qquad \\{q\\}d\\{r\\}}{\\{p\\}c;d\\{r\\}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\{p\\}c\\{q\\}\\qquad \\{q\\}d\\{r\\}}{\\{p\\}c;d\\{r\\}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Conseq}^{678}=\\{((\\{p\\}c\\{q\\}),\\{p&#39;\\}c\\{q&#39;\\}):p,q,p&#39;,q&#39;\\in V_{678},c\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678},\\operatorname{Weaken}_{678}(p,q,p&#39;,q&#39;)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Conseq}^{678}=\\{((\\{p\\}c\\{q\\}),\\{p&#39;\\}c\\{q&#39;\\}):p,q,p&#39;,q&#39;\\in V_{678},c\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678},\\operatorname{Weaken}_{678}(p,q,p&#39;,q&#39;)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Frame}^{678}=\\{((\\{p\\}c\\{q\\}),\\{p\\cdot_{678}r\\}c\\{q\\cdot_{678}r\\}):p,q,r\\in V_{678},c\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Frame}^{678}=\\{((\\{p\\}c\\{q\\}),\\{p\\cdot_{678}r\\}c\\{q\\cdot_{678}r\\}):p,q,r\\in V_{678},c\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Seq}^{678}=\\{((\\{p\\}c\\{q\\},\\{q\\}d\\{r\\}),\\{p\\}c;d\\{r\\}):p,q,r\\in V_{678},c,d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Seq}^{678}=\\{((\\{p\\}c\\{q\\},\\{q\\}d\\{r\\}),\\{p\\}c;d\\{r\\}):p,q,r\\in V_{678},c,d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{678}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{Conseq}^{678}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Frame}^{678}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Seq}^{678}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{678}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{Conseq}^{678}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Frame}^{678}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Seq}^{678}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{VTrip}_{678}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{VTrip}_{678}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathsf{VTrip}_{678}\">\\(T\\in\\mathsf{VTrip}_{678}\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{678}(\\Gamma,T)\">\\(\\mathsf{Prf}_{678}(\\Gamma,T)\\)</span> 为所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(T_0,\\ldots,T_{m-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=(T_0,\\ldots,T_{m-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad m&gt;0,\\quad T_i\\in\\mathsf{VTrip}_{678}\\ \\text{对所有 }i&lt;m,\\quad T_{m-1}=T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad m&gt;0,\\quad T_i\\in\\mathsf{VTrip}_{678}\\ \\text{对所有 }i&lt;m,\\quad T_{m-1}=T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个合法行索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 至少满足下列 5 项中的一项（各项之间为析取，各项内部条件为合取）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(T_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{678}\">\\(T_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{678}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((T_j),T_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Conseq}^{678}\">\\(((T_j),T_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Conseq}^{678}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((T_j),T_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Frame}^{678}\">\\(((T_j),T_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Frame}^{678}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((T_j,T_k),T_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Seq}^{678}\">\\(((T_j,T_k),T_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Seq}^{678}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{678}\\{p\\}c\\{q\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{678}\\{p\\}c\\{q\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{678}(\\Gamma,(p,c,q))\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prf}_{678}(\\Gamma,(p,c,q))\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{678}=\\{T\\in\\mathsf{VTrip}_{678}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{678}T\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{678}=\\{T\\in\\mathsf{VTrip}_{678}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{678}T\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>Views 框架逻辑的目标差异是显式视图代数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_{678}\">\\(\\mathcal V_{678}\\)</span>，frame 规则使用代数乘法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot_{678}\">\\(\\cdot_{678}\\)</span>，consequence 规则使用预序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_{678}\">\\(\\preceq_{678}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-视图转移语义\">10. 视图转移语义</h1>\n<p>Views 语义模型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M=(\\mathsf S_M,\\mathsf Split_M,\\mathsf Sat_M,\\mathsf T_M),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M=(\\mathsf S_M,\\mathsf Split_M,\\mathsf Sat_M,\\mathsf T_M),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_M\">\\(\\mathsf S_M\\)</span> 是状态集合，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf Split_M\\subseteq\\mathsf S_M\\times\\mathsf S_M\\times\\mathsf S_M,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf Split_M\\subseteq\\mathsf S_M\\times\\mathsf S_M\\times\\mathsf S_M,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf Sat_M\\subseteq\\mathsf S_M\\times V_{678},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf Sat_M\\subseteq\\mathsf S_M\\times V_{678},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf T_M:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf S_M\\times\\mathsf S_M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf T_M:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf S_M\\times\\mathsf S_M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Mod}_{678}\">\\(\\mathsf{Mod}_{678}\\)</span> 为所有满足下列条件的这种四元组的类。</p>\n<p>视图满足关系记为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\Vdash^M_{678}p\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad (s,p)\\in\\mathsf Sat_M.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\Vdash^M_{678}p\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad (s,p)\\in\\mathsf Sat_M.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>模型必须满足单调性与乘法组合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\preceq_{678}q\\land s\\Vdash^M_{678}p\\Rightarrow s\\Vdash^M_{678}q,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\preceq_{678}q\\land s\\Vdash^M_{678}p\\Rightarrow s\\Vdash^M_{678}q,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\Vdash^M_{678}p\\cdot_{678}q\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists s_1,s_2\\in\\mathsf S_M\\,\n(\\mathsf Split_M(s,s_1,s_2)\\land s_1\\Vdash^M_{678}p\\land s_2\\Vdash^M_{678}q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\Vdash^M_{678}p\\cdot_{678}q\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists s_1,s_2\\in\\mathsf S_M\\,\n(\\mathsf Split_M(s,s_1,s_2)\\land s_1\\Vdash^M_{678}p\\land s_2\\Vdash^M_{678}q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命令转移记为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\Rightarrow^M_{678,c}t\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad (s,t)\\in\\mathsf T_M(c),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\Rightarrow^M_{678,c}t\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad (s,t)\\in\\mathsf T_M(c),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf T_M(c;d)=\\{(s,u):\\exists t\\in\\mathsf S_M\\,((s,t)\\in\\mathsf T_M(c)\\land(t,u)\\in\\mathsf T_M(d))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf T_M(c;d)=\\{(s,u):\\exists t\\in\\mathsf S_M\\,((s,t)\\in\\mathsf T_M(c)\\land(t,u)\\in\\mathsf T_M(d))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个注册的原子命令规格必须由模型实现：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall(p,a,q)\\in\\mathsf{PrimSpec}_{678}\\ \\forall s,t\\in\\mathsf S_M\\,\n\\bigl(s\\Vdash^M_{678}p\\land(s,t)\\in\\mathsf T_M(\\operatorname{prim}(a))\n\\Rightarrow t\\Vdash^M_{678}q\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall(p,a,q)\\in\\mathsf{PrimSpec}_{678}\\ \\forall s,t\\in\\mathsf S_M\\,\n\\bigl(s\\Vdash^M_{678}p\\land(s,t)\\in\\mathsf T_M(\\operatorname{prim}(a))\n\\Rightarrow t\\Vdash^M_{678}q\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命令转移还必须满足 frame 保持条件：对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q,r\\in V_{678}\">\\(p,q,r\\in V_{678}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\">\\(c\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\bigl(\\forall s,t\\in\\mathsf S_M\\,\n(s\\Vdash^M_{678}p\\land(s,t)\\in\\mathsf T_M(c)\\Rightarrow t\\Vdash^M_{678}q)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(\\forall s,t\\in\\mathsf S_M\\,\n(s\\Vdash^M_{678}p\\cdot_{678}r\\land(s,t)\\in\\mathsf T_M(c)\n\\Rightarrow t\\Vdash^M_{678}q\\cdot_{678}r)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\bigl(\\forall s,t\\in\\mathsf S_M\\,\n(s\\Vdash^M_{678}p\\land(s,t)\\in\\mathsf T_M(c)\\Rightarrow t\\Vdash^M_{678}q)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(\\forall s,t\\in\\mathsf S_M\\,\n(s\\Vdash^M_{678}p\\cdot_{678}r\\land(s,t)\\in\\mathsf T_M(c)\n\\Rightarrow t\\Vdash^M_{678}q\\cdot_{678}r)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义模型索引的满足关系族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SatRel}_{678}\n=\n\\{(M,s,p):M\\in\\mathsf{Mod}_{678},\\ s\\in\\mathsf S_M,\\ p\\in V_{678},\\ s\\Vdash^M_{678}p\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SatRel}_{678}\n=\n\\{(M,s,p):M\\in\\mathsf{Mod}_{678},\\ s\\in\\mathsf S_M,\\ p\\in V_{678},\\ s\\Vdash^M_{678}p\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义模型索引的命令转移族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TransRel}_{678}\n=\n\\{(M,c,s,t):M\\in\\mathsf{Mod}_{678},\\ c\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678},\\ s,t\\in\\mathsf S_M,\\ s\\Rightarrow^M_{678,c}t\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TransRel}_{678}\n=\n\\{(M,c,s,t):M\\in\\mathsf{Mod}_{678},\\ c\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678},\\ s,t\\in\\mathsf S_M,\\ s\\Rightarrow^M_{678,c}t\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-三元组有效性与语义后果\">11. 三元组有效性与语义后果</h1>\n<p>Views 三元组有效性定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M\\models_{678}\\{p\\}c\\{q\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M\\models_{678}\\{p\\}c\\{q\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf S_M\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf S_M\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\Vdash^M_{678}p\\land s\\Rightarrow^M_{678,c}t\\Rightarrow t\\Vdash^M_{678}q.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\Vdash^M_{678}p\\land s\\Rightarrow^M_{678,c}t\\Rightarrow t\\Vdash^M_{678}q.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>frame 语义条件为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SFrame}^M_{678}(p,c,q,r)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nM\\models_{678}\\{p\\}c\\{q\\}\\Rightarrow M\\models_{678}\\{p\\cdot_{678}r\\}c\\{q\\cdot_{678}r\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SFrame}^M_{678}(p,c,q,r)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nM\\models_{678}\\{p\\}c\\{q\\}\\Rightarrow M\\models_{678}\\{p\\cdot_{678}r\\}c\\{q\\cdot_{678}r\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SFrame}_{678}\n=\n\\{(M,p,c,q,r):M\\in\\mathsf{Mod}_{678},\\ p,q,r\\in V_{678},\\ c\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678},\\operatorname{SFrame}^M_{678}(p,c,q,r)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SFrame}_{678}\n=\n\\{(M,p,c,q,r):M\\in\\mathsf{Mod}_{678},\\ p,q,r\\in V_{678},\\ c\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678},\\operatorname{SFrame}^M_{678}(p,c,q,r)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后果定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{678}T\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{678}T\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathsf{Mod}_{678}\">\\(M\\in\\mathsf{Mod}_{678}\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\models_{678}U\">\\(M\\models_{678}U\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\Gamma\">\\(U\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\models_{678}T\">\\(M\\models_{678}T\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"12.-整个句法与语义形式系统\">12. 整个句法与语义形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{Views}^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{678}=(V_{678},\\cdot_{678},\\varepsilon_{678},\\preceq_{678},\\mathsf{PrimCmd}_{678},\\mathsf{PrimSpec}_{678},\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678},\\mathsf{VTrip}_{678},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{678},\\operatorname{FC}_{678},\\operatorname{BV}_{678},\\operatorname{BC}_{678},\n\\operatorname{CSub}_{678},\\operatorname{TripSub}_{678},\\operatorname{Frame}_{678},\\operatorname{Weaken}_{678},\\equiv_{\\alpha,678},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{678},\\mathsf{Rule}_{678},\\vdash_{678},\\mathsf{Thm}_{678},\n\\mathsf{Mod}_{678},\\mathsf{SatRel}_{678},\\mathsf{TransRel}_{678},\\mathsf{SFrame}_{678},\\models_{678}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{Views}^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{678}=(V_{678},\\cdot_{678},\\varepsilon_{678},\\preceq_{678},\\mathsf{PrimCmd}_{678},\\mathsf{PrimSpec}_{678},\\mathsf{Cmd}_{678},\\mathsf{VTrip}_{678},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{678},\\operatorname{FC}_{678},\\operatorname{BV}_{678},\\operatorname{BC}_{678},\n\\operatorname{CSub}_{678},\\operatorname{TripSub}_{678},\\operatorname{Frame}_{678},\\operatorname{Weaken}_{678},\\equiv_{\\alpha,678},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{678},\\mathsf{Rule}_{678},\\vdash_{678},\\mathsf{Thm}_{678},\n\\mathsf{Mod}_{678},\\mathsf{SatRel}_{678},\\mathsf{TransRel}_{678},\\mathsf{SFrame}_{678},\\models_{678}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含视图代数、状态满足关系、命令转移、frame 语义条件、三元组有效性和证明关系；不涉及具体资源实例或程序语言实现。</p>\n<h1 id=\"13.-008-视图代数与-frame-闭包\">13. 008 视图代数与 frame 闭包</h1>\n<p>把视图代数定律集中为本地谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ViewAlg}_{678}(V_{678},\\cdot_{678},\\varepsilon_{678},\\preceq_{678})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ViewAlg}_{678}(V_{678},\\cdot_{678},\\varepsilon_{678},\\preceq_{678})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot_{678}\">\\(\\cdot_{678}\\)</span> 结合、交换、以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_{678}\">\\(\\varepsilon_{678}\\)</span> 为单位，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_{678}\">\\(\\preceq_{678}\\)</span> 为预序，且乘法对预序双调。模型满足的单调性为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SatMono}_{678}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall p,q\\in V_{678}\\ \\forall s\\in\\mathsf S_M\\ (p\\preceq_{678}q\\land M,s\\Vdash_{678}p\\Rightarrow M,s\\Vdash_{678}q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SatMono}_{678}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall p,q\\in V_{678}\\ \\forall s\\in\\mathsf S_M\\ (p\\preceq_{678}q\\land M,s\\Vdash_{678}p\\Rightarrow M,s\\Vdash_{678}q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>全 frame 条件为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FrameAll}_{678}(M,p,c,q)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall r\\in V_{678}\\ \\operatorname{SFrame}^{M}_{678}(p,c,q,r).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FrameAll}_{678}(M,p,c,q)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall r\\in V_{678}\\ \\operatorname{SFrame}^{M}_{678}(p,c,q,r).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>闭合系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{Views}^{008}_{678}\n=(\\mathcal{Views}^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{678},\\operatorname{ViewAlg}_{678},\\operatorname{SatMono}_{678},\\operatorname{FrameAll}_{678},\\mathsf{Prf}_{678}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{Views}^{008}_{678}\n=(\\mathcal{Views}^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{678},\\operatorname{ViewAlg}_{678},\\operatorname{SatMono}_{678},\\operatorname{FrameAll}_{678},\\mathsf{Prf}_{678}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-视图代数与判断","text":"2. 视图代数与判断","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由名","text":"3. 自由名","level":1},{"id":"4.-结构操作","text":"4. 结构操作","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则关系","text":"6. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-视图转移语义","text":"10. 视图转移语义","level":1},{"id":"11.-三元组有效性与语义后果","text":"11. 三元组有效性与语义后果","level":1},{"id":"12.-整个句法与语义形式系统","text":"12. 整个句法与语义形式系统","level":1},{"id":"13.-008-视图代数与-frame-闭包","text":"13. 008 视图代数与 frame 闭包","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal V_{678}=(V_{678},\\cdot_{678},\\varepsilon_{678},\\preceq_{678})","display":true},{"tex":"V_{678}","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot_{678}:V_{678}\\times V_{678}\\to V_{678}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_{678}\\in V_{678}","display":false},{"tex":"\\preceq_{678}\\subseteq V_{67